# Executor-Py SDK — Concept Architecture (UPDATED)
# Authority: CSA-sealed

## 1. Canonical Position

```text
                    CONA (Fractal Executor)
                         │
                ┌────────┴────────┐
                ▼                 ▼
            CAPOR             RACOR
          (WHAT)            (HOW/WHERE)
                │                 │
                └────────┬────────┘
                         ▼
                    IPO Pipeline
                   (Input→Process→Output)
                         │
              ┌──────────┼──────────┐
              ▼                       ▼
     executor-py          executor-rs
    (Python Native)      (Rust Native)
         │                       │
         ▼                       ▼
   py-text-editor        Native Rust particles
```

## 2. Architecture (FES-Aligned)

```text
executor-py/
├── .know/
│   ├── canon/                    # CSA-sealed canonical documents
│   │   ├── FES.ail               # Fractal Execute Structure model
