│   └── concept/architecture.ail  # THIS FILE
├── src/
│   └── executor_py/
│       ├── __init__.py           # Public API exports
│       ├── core.py               # ExecuteParticle, ExecContext/ExecInput/ExecOutput,
│       │                         # SepiProof, FanId/FanCapability/FanRegistry, Nep,
│       │                         # SIO envelope types (SioEnvelope, SioResult, TransportConfig)
│       ├── actor/                # Actor (Engine) — FES Layer: ENGINE
│       │   └── __init__.py       # Actor, ActorConfig, CompositeActor, CompositeActorConfig
│       ├── executor/             # Executor (Engine Part) — FES Layer: EXECUTOR
│       │   └── __init__.py       # Executor, ExecutorConfig, SimpleExecutor
│       ├── module/               # Module (Capability) — FES Layer: MODULE
│       │   └── __init__.py       # ExecutorModule, ModuleConfig, FdiModule, FpiModule, LibraryModule
│       ├── ipo.py                # IpoFeature trait, IpoInput/Process/Output,
│       │                         # IpoOrchestrator, CaporDecision, RacRoute,
│       │                         # DefaultIpoOrchestrator
│       ├── capor.py              # CaporRouter trait, DefaultCaporRouter,
│       │                         # SecurityProfile, Scorer
│       ├── racor.py              # RacRouter trait, DefaultRacRouter,
│       │                         # RacUri (V4 parser), RacTransportKind, RacRule,
│       │                         # UriClassification
│       ├── evidence.py           # compute_feh_hash, seal_alr_record, build_proof
│       ├── payload.py            # IpoPayload, ValidatedPayload, extract_payload, validate_payload
│       ├── adapter.py            # RacTransport trait (mirrors io/rac/src/core.rs),
│       │                         # LocalNativeAdapter, StdioIpcAdapter
│       ├── simple.py             # SimpleExecutor (default IPO orchestrator)
│       └── io/                   # RAC transport layer
│           ├── __init__.py
│           ├── rac/
│           │   ├── __init__.py
│           │   ├── cri/
│           │   │   ├── __init__.py
│           │   │   ├── fdi.py    # FDI: Wired/autoload (USB cable)
│           │   │   ├── fpi.py    # FPI: Wireless (Bluetooth/NFC)
│           │   │   └── ffi.py    # FFI: Native bridge (zero-copy)
│           │   └── contracts.py  # RAC Method Contracts (call/import/instance/ping/stream)
│           └── transport/        # RION transports
│               ├── __init__.py
│               ├── stdio.py   # STDIO JSON-RPC 2.0
│               ├── http.py    # HTTP/JSON bridge
│               └── ws.py      # WebSocket bridge
├── tests/
│   ├── rota/                     # Runtime Operation Test Audit
│   │   ├── test_core_types.py
│   │   ├── test_ipo_pipeline.py
│   │   ├── test_fdi_transport.py
│   │   ├── test_fpi_transport.py
│   │   ├── test_capor_resolution.py
│   │   ├── test_racor_resolution.py
│   │   ├── test_evidence_sealing.py
│   │   └── test_actor_executor_mapping.py
├── scripts/                     # check.ps1, test.ps1, crystallize.ps1, seal.ps1
└── pyproject.toml
```

## 3. FES IPO Flow

```text
Caller
    │
    │ rac://cri.hace.fdi/hace/py-text-editor/file/read_file
    │ SIORequest { method: "call", actor: "<rac_uri>", payload: {...} }
    ▼
Actor.execute()
    │
    ├── IpoFeature.input()
    │   ├── normalize RAC URI → RacUri (V4 parser)
    │   ├── validate SIO
    │   ├── resolve topology → FanId
    │   └── create ExecContext + ExecInput
    │
    ├── IpoFeature.process()
    │   ├── CaporRouter.resolve() → CaporDecision (WHAT capacity)
    │   ├── RacRouter.resolve_route() → RacRoute (HOW/WHERE transport + machine)
    │   ├── CEP Resolver → ExecutionPlan (method routing)
    │   └── Select ExecuteParticle from FanRegistry
    │
    ├── ExecuteParticle.execute()
    │   ├── Domain logic (file read, string transform, ...)
    │   └── Produce ExecOutput + SepiProof (FEH + ALR)
    │
    └── IpoFeature.output()
        ├── finalize SIO
        ├── seal evidence (proof.seal())
        └── return SioResponse
```

## 4. FES Layer Mapping

| Layer | Class | Purpose | Authority |
|---|---|---|---|
| ENGINE | Actor | Runtime Engine with Authority + Lifecycle | Full |
| EXECUTOR | Executor | IPO Processor / MCV Controller | No Authority |
| MODULE | ExecutorModule | Atomic Capability Implementation | No Authority |
| LIBRARY | LibraryModule | Pure Algorithm/Data | No Authority |

## 5. Integration with py-text-editor

| Capability Namespace | Executor Package | Register Path |
|---|---|---|
| `io.mcp.server.core.file.*` | `text-editor/io/mcp/server/core/file.py` | `registry.register(FanCapability(..., executor="py-text-editor"))` |
| `io.mcp.server.core.uri.*` | `text-editor/io/mcp/server/core/uri.py` | same |
| `io.mcp.server.core.str.*` | `text-editor/io/mcp/server/core/str.py` | same |
| `io.rac.cri.fdi.*` | `text-editor/io/rac/cri/fdi.py` | same |

## 6. Forge Integration (hace-rosa/forge/)

| Module | Role | Integrates With |
|---|---|---|
| `hace-cep-resolver` | Method Router (CEP) | Capor + Racor + LION/RION |
| `hace-lion-exchange` | Registry/Binding/Discovery | FanRegistry + Actor/Executor |
| `hace-lion-machine` | Local IO Execution (5-module pipeline) | FDI/FFI/MCP adapters |
| `hace-racor-resolver` | Route Resolution (HOW/WHERE) | RacRouter + RAC URI V4 |
| `hace-rion-machine` | Remote IO (AMO/httpx) | HttpTransport + GrpcBridge |
| `hace-sio-stream` | Streaming Transport | FPI/Wireless + SSE/WS |

